  "headline": "Andi Amran Sulaiman and Sugiono Undergo Health Exams for VP Role",
  "seoTitle": "Andi Amran Sulaiman and Sugiono Undergo Health Exams",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto's potential vice president candidates, Andi Amran Sulaiman and Sugiono, have completed mandatory health screenings at RSPAD.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Andi Amran Sulaiman and Sugiono completed mandatory medical examinations at RSPAD Gatot Subroto as part of the vice-presidential selection process.",
    "Results from the health assessments, conducted by 25 physicians, are scheduled to be formally announced on December 1.",
    "Political discussions remain ongoing regarding the candidates, with observers noting Amran's technocratic experience and Sugiono's record of loyalty."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The political landscape is currently focused on the selection of a new vice president following the vacancy of the position previously held by Gibran. President Prabowo Subianto has proposed two candidates for the role: Andi Amran Sulaiman and Sugiono. Both individuals have recently concluded their medical evaluations at RSPAD Gatot Subroto in Jakarta, a requirement for their candidacy. The findings from these screenings, performed by a team of 25 medical professionals, are expected to be delivered to the People's Consultative Assembly (MPR) before the official announcement on December 1. While political parties and observers evaluate the respective strengths of both candidates, representatives from the PDIP have urged the MPR to ensure that the selection process strictly follows constitutional guidelines.",
